title: Spread the Strike
subtitle: Berlin is out. The rest of Germany is wavering.
view-if: crisis_cuno = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.cunoTick(Q.crisis_time + 1);
Q.e23_rail_p = Math.min(0.85, 0.25 + Q.worker_support / 200 + (Q.e22_railway == 1 ? 0.2 : 0));
Q.e23_rail_odds = RG.e22.odds(Q.e23_rail_p);
Q.e23_rail_joined = 0;
Q.e23_cuno_new = 0;
Q.e23_cuno_has_new = 0;
!}
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: crisis

= Spread the Strike

The strike is strongest in Berlin and weakest where the unions are strong. The Ruhr miners are already idle under the French. The railwaymen have not struck since their own defeat in February 1922.

- @rail: Send our best speakers to the railway depots.
- @couriers: Send couriers with the strike call to every district.
- @ruhr: Bring the Ruhr pit committees into the strike.

@rail
subtitle: If the trains stop, the strike is national. The depot secretaries call the chances [+ e23_rail_odds +].
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_rail_joined = Math.random() < Q.e23_rail_p ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.e23_rail_joined) {
    RG.startStrike('halle', true);
    Q.e23_cuno_pressure += 15;
} else {
    Q.e23_cuno_pressure += 3;
}
RG.e22.cunoLines();
!}

[? if e23_rail_joined = 1 : The depots of Berlin, Halle and Leipzig vote to come out. By evening the trains have stopped on the main lines. ?][? if e23_rail_joined = 1 and e22_railway = 1 : At Lichtenberg the depot men say they remember who came out for them last year. ?][? if e23_rail_joined = 0 : The railwaymen listen and go back to their engines. A few depots stop for a day. ?]

@couriers
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. The strike reaches the provinces, a day late.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no money for couriers.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
var a = RG.spreadStrike('berlin');
var b = RG.spreadStrike('saxony');
var n = [a, b].filter(function (x) { return x; });
Q.e23_cuno_new = n.length ? RG.e22.list(n) : 0;
Q.e23_cuno_has_new = n.length ? 1 : 0;
Q.e23_cuno_pressure += 3;
RG.e22.cunoLines();
!}

Couriers on motorcycles carry the call to Stettin, Breslau and the small towns. [? if e23_cuno_has_new = 1 : [+ e23_cuno_new +] come out. ?][? if e23_cuno_has_new = 0 : Everywhere that could come out is out already. ?]

@ruhr
subtitle: The Ruhr is eager. The French will enjoy watching Germans fight Germans.
view-if: district_ruhr_strike = 0
on-arrival: {!
RG.startStrike('ruhr', true);
RG.district('ruhr', {loyalty: 4, repression: 4});
Q.e23_cuno_pressure += 4;
RG.e22.cunoLines();
!}

The pit committees turn their strike against the French into a strike against Cuno.
